        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Ships: USS Tortuga (LSD-46)\n- Classes: Whidbey Island-class dock landing ships\n- Organizations: United States Navy\n- Places: Dry Tortugas, Key West, Florida\n- Topics: City mottos\n\nFacts:\n- USS Tortuga (LSD-46) is a Whidbey Island-class dock landing ship of the United States Navy.\n- USS Tortuga (LSD-46) was the second United States Navy ship named for the Dry Tortugas.\n- The Dry Tortugas are a group of desert coral islets 60 miles west of Key West, Florida.\n- Key West, Florida, has the official city motto \"One Human Family.\"",
